Bundled in this repository
--------------------------

web/maxentpy_src/  (maxentpy)
    A Python port of MaxEntScan, from https://github.com/kepbod/maxentpy,
    released under the MIT licence (web/maxentpy_src/LICENSE). It is kept
    byte-identical to upstream.

    The splice-site scoring tables inside it come from MaxEntScan:
    Copyright 2004, Gene Yeo and Chris Burge. Their notice asks that uses of the
    models cite: Yeo G, Burge CB. Maximum entropy modeling of short sequence
    motifs with applications to RNA splicing signals. Journal of Computational
    Biology 11:377-394 (2004). doi:10.1089/1066527041410418

Not bundled
-----------

SpliceAI, PRIDICT2, ViennaRNA, Cas-OFFinder, Boltz-2, AlphaFold DB data and the
other packages listed in pyproject.toml are installed separately by whoever runs
the pipeline. Each keeps its own licence and terms; those are not changed by the
licence of this repository. Check them before any use beyond academic research.
